			<div class="content" id="post-content-901330">
									

<p>I don't think the comment about terminating people cultivating this SCP belongs here. The Foundation doesn't care about drug dealers… If anything, I would suspect the directive to have field agents either infiltrate such groups in order to locate possible sources of the bug, or simply firebomb the cultivation sites (read: the VICTIMS, not the cartel members) to remove more 456 from the wild.</p>
<p>Also, euphoria AND sleepiness? At the same time? Because that's how this sounds to me… Yeah, I'm nitpicking :-)</p>
